notes.notes:
~ Added [b]six new random events[/b] to the Q dimension. There are two types of these events: [b]minefields[/b] and [b]arenas[/b]. You receive a valuable reward after completing them;
~ Organs are no longer destroyed if you die. They [b]break[/b] and you can ask Gilimantus in the H.U.B. to fix them by paying 15% of an item's price;
~ Decreased push back of Void's weapons;
~ Updated the prices of Heralds' organs;
~ Architech items are now crafted with nodes and runes;
~ Fixed broken subtech items being displayed incorrectly;
~ Corrected errors in tutorial texts, loading screen tips and descriptions: "Subtech Repair" (tutorial), equipment (loading screen tip), wounds (loading screen tip and wound descriptions on a character), damage (tips on damage types).


Please, update the game via Steam.

